      "blurb": "Hozuki: Steam Imp",
      "summonRole": "Steam Imp",
      "biography": "<p><em>Steaming Danger: Tyranny (Hozuki Hijutsu).</em> You can command the imp as a bonus action on your turns. It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and Save DC for effects that require an attack or saving throw. Strength, Dexterity and Constitution saving throws this creature makes use your Ninjutsu ability modifier as its proficiency bonus.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct, unaligned.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 14 + Your Ninjutsu Ability Modifier · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 10 · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +7, DEX +3, CON +4, INT −5, WIS +0, CHA −5. <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Cold, Fire. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, All Sensory, Chilled, Bleed, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> its AC (14 + your Ninjutsu ability modifier), Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
    },
